<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables -.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables -.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Monday that Airborne Freight Corp, Tupperware Corp, Standard Motor Products Inc and Weeks Corp were not available for after-hours trading for news.</p>
<p>The exchange also said Corimon SACA was unavailable.</p>
